autoheal-go
dist/

# Everything the integration suites build: the project under test and the
# image build contexts. Removed on cleanup, so they are only ever here after a
# run that was killed -- which is exactly when they would be committed by
# accident.
#
# A prefix rather than a list, so a directory that does not exist yet is
# covered too.
/testbed*/
coverage.out

# The suite's helper programs, when built directly rather than into their
# images -- `go build ./test/integration/patient/` drops one here, and it is
# the sort of thing that gets committed in a hurry.
/patient
/receiver
/sandbox
